相。仇液將行，其客宋公謂液曰：「秦不聽公，樓緩必怨公。公不若謂樓緩曰『請為公毋急秦』。秦王見趙請相魏冉之不急，且不聽公。公言而事不成，以德樓子；事成，魏冉故德公矣。」於是仇液從之。而秦果免樓緩而魏冉相秦。","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-072-rang","source_id":"s-shiji-072-rang","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-072-rang:p003","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/072.json"}],"basis":{"kind":"parallel_event","source_event_quote":"秦果免樓緩","reference_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷015&oldid=2607002","reference_event_quote":"十二。樓緩免。穰侯魏冉為丞相。","reference_year_quote":"295"},"references":[{"title":"《史記》卷十五〈六國年表〉事件欄","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷015&oldid=2607002","quote":"十二。樓緩免。穰侯魏冉為丞相。","scope":"received_parallel_event","image_verified":false,"table_cell_id":"shiji-015-r182-c02"},{"title":"〈六國年表〉數位年欄","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷015&oldid=2607002","quote":"295","scope":"digital_editorial_regnal_year_equivalence_only","image_verified":false,"table_cell_id":"shiji-015-r182-c00"}],"rationale":"樓緩免相與年表十二年樓緩免對讀；不把段首七年樗里子死套用到免相。數字年取同列數位編者對照，僅到年，未核印本影像及曆表，來源異說與未知起訖保留。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false}}},"interpretation_note":"授封、授官與單純用稱分存，反覆任相各保存來源事件；未知曆日不補，時長保留原引文。免相國不自動終止穰侯爵、將軍或其他官爵，卒與收陶亦不作所有稱號共同終點。 樓緩免相與年表十二年樓緩免對讀；不把段首七年樗里子死套用到免相。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[{"id":"pa-shiji072-002","person_id":"p41_n3z_dlq","relation":"biographical_origin","place":{"source_name":"趙","place_id":null,"modern_identification":null},"status":"source_attested","date_expression":null,"source_term":"趙人樓緩","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-072-rang","source_id":"s-shiji-072-rang","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-072-rang:p003","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-072-rang:m003-0021","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/072.json"}],"interpretation_note":"保存原地名與來源範圍；其先是未名祖先，不轉本人出生地。死亡與埋葬、放逐及逃奔分存，不把段首紀年套到整段所有事件，不補現代轄區。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false}],"table_occurrences":[{"id":"shiji-015-r182-c02-m003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"樓緩","person_id":"p41_n3z_dlq","status":"contextual_provisiona